### Connector Extension Test Requests
### Base URL: http://localhost:7071/runtime/webhooks/connector

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/runtime/webhooks/connector

### =============================================================================
### Echo - Simple test
### =============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}?functionName=Echo
Content-Type: application/json

{"test": "Hello, Connector!"}

### =============================================================================
### O365 OnEmail - Microsoft Graph Email Notification
### =============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}?functionName=OnEmail
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": [{
    "subscriptionId": "sub-123",
    "changeType": "created",
    "resource": "Users/user@contoso.com/Messages/AAMkAG",
    "resourceData": {
      "@odata.type": "#Microsoft.Graph.Message",
      "id": "AAMkAG123",
      "subject": "URGENT: Project Update Required",
      "from": {"emailAddress": {"name": "John Doe", "address": "john@contoso.com"}},
      "receivedDateTime": "2026-03-17T10:30:00Z"
    }
  }]
}

### =============================================================================
### Teams OnMessage - Teams Bot Activity
### =============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}?functionName=OnTeamsMessage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "message",
  "id": "msg-123",
  "timestamp": "2026-03-17T10:30:00Z",
  "channelId": "msteams",
  "from": {"id": "user-123", "name": "Jane Smith"},
  "conversation": {"id": "conv-456", "name": "Project Alpha"},
  "recipient": {"id": "bot-789", "name": "ConnectorBot"},
  "text": "@ConnectorBot help me with the project status",
  "entities": [{"type": "mention", "mentioned": {"id": "bot-789"}}]
}

### =============================================================================
### SharePoint OnListItemCreated - SharePoint List Change
### =============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}?functionName=OnSharePointItem
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": [{
    "subscriptionId": "sp-sub-123",
    "changeType": "created",
    "resource": "sites/contoso.sharepoint.com/lists/Projects/items/42",
    "siteUrl": "https://contoso.sharepoint.com/sites/TeamSite",
    "resourceData": {
      "id": "42",
      "fields": {
        "Title": "New Project Kickoff",
        "Status": "Planning",
        "AssignedTo": "user@contoso.com",
        "DueDate": "2026-04-01"
      }
    }
  }]
}

### =============================================================================
### GitHub OnPush - GitHub Webhook
### =============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}?functionName=OnGitHubPush
Content-Type: application/json
X-GitHub-Event: push
X-GitHub-Delivery: abc-123-def

{
  "ref": "refs/heads/main",
  "repository": {"full_name": "owner/repo"},
  "pusher": {"name": "developer"},
  "commits": [
    {"message": "feat: add new feature"},
    {"message": "fix: resolve bug"},
    {"message": "docs: update README"}
  ]
}
